LANYUE

This release contains the five-modal CE2-anchor v2 lunar pretraining path
and its native NAC frozen-teacher distillation extension.
The shared hierarchical encoder and masked reconstruction implementation are
adapted from HiViT. The upstream MIT LICENSE is retained verbatim.

HiViT paper:
Zhang, Xiaosong; Tian, Yunjie; Xie, Lingxi; Huang, Wei; Dai, Qi;
Ye, Qixiang; Tian, Qi. HiViT: A Simpler and More Efficient Design of
Hierarchical Vision Transformer. ICLR 2023.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.14949

The positional embedding utilities retain their original Meta Platforms,
Inc. copyright notice and source references. Third-party dependencies retain
their respective licenses.

Data files, pretrained weights and training logs are distributed separately
from this source repository. Dataset and model-weight redistribution terms
are specified in their respective releases; the code license does not
relicense upstream lunar observations or scientific catalogues.
